flowchart TB
    U[Customers / Browsers] --> DNS[Azure DNS]
    DNS --> EDGE[Azure Front Door + WAF]
    EDGE --> AGW[Application Gateway WAF v2]
    subgraph VNET["VNet - Primary Region"]
      subgraph APP["Private application subnets - 3 zones"]
        AKS[AKS or Azure Container Apps]
        WORK[Async worker workloads]
      end
      subgraph DATA["Private data subnet / private endpoints"]
        DB[(Azure SQL / PostgreSQL Flexible Server HA)]
        CACHE[(Azure Managed Redis option)]
      end
      NAT[Azure NAT Gateway / controlled egress]
      PE[Private Endpoints + Private DNS]
      KV[Key Vault + Managed Identity]
      MON[Azure Monitor + Log Analytics]
      BUS[Service Bus]
      OBJ[Blob Storage with versioning]
      AKS --> DB
      AKS --> CACHE
      AKS --> BUS
      WORK --> BUS
      AKS --> KV
      AKS --> PE
      DB --> MON
      AKS --> MON
      WORK --> OBJ
    end
    AGW --> AKS
    DB -. geo-backup / replica .-> DR[Recovery Region]
    OBJ -. geo-redundancy / replication .-> DR
